nd Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/barnes-county"],["ARC or PLC in Barnes County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/barnes-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Barnes County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, more than any other pair, and June to July in 29. In 2026 so far, June to July sits at 67% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid listed had its driest year in 1976, with grid 31930 at 43%.</p>"}
